</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00172" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00172" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00172-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/freezingheart" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6401769); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6401769&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607051335" alt="Freezingheart" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6401769)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/freezingheart" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6401769); return false;">Freezingheart</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1588999313 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">09 May 2020 04:41</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00209/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一副圆规，在被使用时两腿间距会以每秒0.05cm的速度扩大。该圆规在两腿间距最大时将不会再扩大。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/05/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>研究员仗助的办公室<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>存放于Site-CN-██低价值异常物品仓库中。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>我终于知道为什么我的圆规总是用不好了</em>——研究员仗助<br />
<em>啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊我要疯啦！这什么[脏话已编辑]圆规！</em>——试图正常使用的Jo███博士<br />
<em>有一说一，用这个圆规画螺旋线挺好用的</em>——研究员Oku████</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00209" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00209" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00209-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/higashikatajosuke" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6150792); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6150792&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607051335" alt="HigashikataJosuke" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6150792)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/higashikatajosuke" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6150792); return false;">HigashikataJosuke</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1589638016 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">16 May 2020 14:06</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00461/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一本███页的小说，每次打开时名称、内容、人名和对话都会转变为其他小说的内容<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██市██街新华书店<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>放置于Site-CN-██的图书室中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>古之帝王一把抓住李狗蛋的脖子？——正在新华书店买书的研究员guzl</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00461" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00461" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00461-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/guzl" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6264210); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6264210&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607051335" alt="guzl" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6264210)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/guzl" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6264210); return false;">guzl</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1605343870 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">14 Nov 2020 08:51</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00443/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一杯███牌橙汁，杯身呈现透明状态，其上用棕色小字印着“保护环境，举手之劳”的字样。任何试图丢弃该项目的个体都无法将其投入正确分类的垃圾桶中。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/10/16<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>于“站点环保日”被发现于Site-CN-██的不可回收垃圾桶中。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>放置于PK博士的垃圾袋中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>我抗议，本人是名副其实的环保之星，之前将垃圾扔错垃圾桶纯粹是他人陷害，建议进行调查。——PK博士</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00443" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00443" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00443-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pknoland" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3420430); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3420430&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607051335" alt="PKNOLAND" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3420430)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pknoland" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3420430); return false;">PKNOLAND</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1602863693 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">16 Oct 2020 15:54</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
    
